            "backendName": "result.connectType",
            "description_en": "The connectivity type of the virtual private cloud (VPC) firewall. Valid values: cen, which indicates Cloud Enterprise Network",
            "description_zh": "VPC边界防火墙的互通类型。取值：cen，表示云企业网",
